[oshverdas]

OpenVPN with Tunnelblick xor patches for traffic obfuscation.

Building on Linux

Install autoconf, automake, libtool, git, and build utils

Build commands:
    autoreconf -vi
    ./configure
    make -j8
The binary can be found at ./src/openvpn/openvpn

If configure fails with
    configure: error: libpam required but missing
Configure without libpam
    ./configure --disable-plugin-auth-pam

Building on Windows

Download and install git
https://git-scm.com/downloads/win

Download and install "Build Tools for Visual Studio 2022"
https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/downloads/
Run "Visual Studio Installer"
Enable "C++/CLI support for ..."
In "Individual Components" type "x64 spectre"
Enable "MSVC ... x64/x86 Spectre-mitigated libs"

Download and install CMake
https://cmake.org/download/

Download and install python
https://www.python.org/downloads/
Tick "Add python to environment variables"
Run cmd
    pip install docutils

Build commands:
    mkdir C:\openvpn
    cd C:\openvpn
    git clone https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg.git
    git clone https://github.com/oshverdas/openvpn-xor.git
    set VCPKG_ROOT=C:\openvpn\vcpkg
    cd openvpn-xor
    cmake --preset win-amd64-release
    cmake --build --preset win-amd64-release

